# Compact Reference Files

Use compact files first save context

- `.mdc` rule files compact model-facing rules
- `SKILL.md` other `.md` skill/reference files compact model-facing files
- `.mdh` files human-readable source or counterpart files

When both compact human files exist read `.mdc` or `.md` during normal agent work Open `.mdh` only when explicitly editing human-facing prose or when compact content not enough complete task safely
